      "name": "[Blueprint][Burnice] Shaker & Mixer - Lv.60",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Burnice's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtainable through Investigation Exploration or purchasable from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: When using a Medicine or launching their own Ultimate, all squad members' Anomaly Proficiency increases by 40 for 300s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration.\nEnemies in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Scorched]</color> state have their Fire RES reduced by 10%, and the Fire Anomaly Buildup dealt by <color=#FFFFFF>[Afterburn]</color> increases by 30%. Every 10 <color=#FFFFFF>[Afterburn]</color> triggers, if the target is affected by an Attribute Anomaly, 1 additional <color=#FFFFFF>[Abloom]</color> effect is triggered, dealing a fixed 360% multiplier of Attribute Anomaly DMG of the corresponding attribute.",
